@#INSTALL
@eventname Sex Change
@author Gordon Lewicky
@authid SexChange117
@codebegin
@runsub SEXCHANGE &filename
@codeend
@target FOREST

@#UNINSTALL

; =============================================================
; Sex Change v1.17
;   Email: ktidmore@bellsouth.net.   Fidonet:  1:123/450
;   WWW: http://camelot.legendarydragons.com/.  As of mid-June 2007.
;
; Goofy events by Gordon Lewicky. Supported by Donald Tidmore.
; This event was written and tested using Lord v4.07á 31 Mar/02 but
; any commands/vars are from previous LORD's. This supports v4.05 & up.
;
; SEXCHANGE  - You come across the faeries but this time they are really angry.
;              They change your sex for spying on them again.
; =============================================================

@#SEXCHANGE
@display
`c  `%Weird Happening In The Forest`0
`l

  `2Wandering along, you come across a large group of playful faeries,
  cavorting in the flowers. You try to sneak away, but they see you.

  `9"Hey there human!! We told you we do not like you spying on us!
  Mayhaps we should teach you a lesson. What do you think Mischievious?"

  "Most definately, Misdemeanor, most definately. Lemme think on it a bit."

  `2You try to run away, but the faeries completely surround you!

@enddisplay
@hitakey
@clrscr
@if &Psx is true 1
  @begin
    @writeln
    @writeln `2Mischievious looks you over, then breaks into a gleeful laugh.
    @writeln
    @writeln `9"Ooooo you are much too ugly to be a woman!" `2She throws some dust on you.
    @set &Psx to false
  @end
@else 1             ; 04/12/05: added identifier 1. DGT.
  @begin
    @writeln `2Mischievious looks you over, then breaks into a gleeful laugh.
    @writeln
    @writeln `9"Ooooo you are much too pretty to be a man!" `2She throws some dust on you.
    @set &Psx to true
  @end
@endif 1

; end of event
@writeln `2
@writeln You sneeze and then suddenly start feeling very strange.
@writeln
@writeln `@"Arggggggg"`2, you scream as you look down at your new body.
@writeln
@writeln Mischievious giggles, while Misdemeanor dances with glee.
@writeln
@writeln `9"I think you better go back to town and change your clothes. Hee hee..."
@writeln `2
@writeln And Misdemeanor pipes in laughing...
@writeln `9
@if &Psx is true 2
  @begin
  @writeln "I think your &Par should have two bumps up there on your chest!
  @writeln It sure looks like it is an awfully tight fit right now, and very,
  @writeln very, uncomfortable, I would guess! Hee hee..."
  @end
@else 2                ; 04/12/05: added identifier 2. DGT.
  @begin
  @writeln "I don't think your &Par should have those two bumps on your chest!
  @writeln It sure makes you look silly. And it looks like you need more room
  @writeln down below. It must be awfully tight there, right now! Hee hee..."
  @end
@endif 2    ; 04/12/05: changed to use identifier 2. DGT.

@writeln `$
@hitakey
@clrscr
@endquest

